(191, 7, 1011361, '{\"id\":1011361,\"name\":\"Deus Ex Remastered\",\"slug\":\"deus-ex-remastered\",\"description\":\"This is Deus Ex Remastered – the definitive version of Ion Storm’s legendary cyberpunk immersive sim, modernized with visual upgrades, modern enhancements, and quality-of-life improvements for a new generation of operatives.\",\"released\":\"2026-02-05\",\"background_image\":null,\"rating\":0,\"rating_top\":0,\"playtime\":0,\"esrb_rating\":\"Not Rated\",\"platforms\":[],\"genres\":[{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"Action\",\"slug\":\"action\"},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Adventure\",\"slug\":\"adventure\"},{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"RPG\",\"slug\":\"role-playing-games-rpg\"}],\"developers\":[{\"id\":17132,\"name\":\"Aspyr Media\",\"slug\":\"aspyr-media\"}],\"publishers\":[{\"id\":3363,\"name\":\"Aspyr\",\"slug\":\"aspyr\"}],\"tags\":[],\"screenshots\":[],\"series\":[],\"stores\":[{\"id\":1013145,\"store\":{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Steam\",\"domain\":\"store.steampowered.com\"}}]}', '2026-01-31 14:32:49'),
(192, 7, 1015656, '{\"id\":1015656,\"name\":\"Dead Pets Unleashed\",\"slug\":\"dead-pets-unleashed\",\"description\":\"\\nKiller Soundtrack: A punk rock EP recorded just for Dead Pets and a ton of indie game crossovers.\\nMinigames for Days: Including working a shift at a diner (diner dash), rhythm games, and making hot dogs.\\nA Demon City filled with Life: New Void City is filled with lively friends and foes, all with their own inner lives.\\nSuccess is in Your Hands: Gordy\'s future and the band\'s fame rest in your hands. Choose your ending!\\nCartoonish Inspirations: For fans of Bojack Horseman and Tuca and Bertie. Inspired by their colorful, surreal worlds, complicated, dynamic friendships, and zany, offbeat humor.\\nManage Your Choices: Every choice affects Gordy\'s wellbeing, the band\'s power, her social points, or her bank account.\\n\\n\\nGordy and her punk band, Dead Pets, have been playing together for… a while, and have never made it big. Heading into their 30s, their personal responsibilities and the band\'s uncertain future is looming over them. Do they have what it takes to give Dead Pets one last shot at success?\\n\\n\\nDead Pets Unleashed is a feminist, management-lite, minigame-heavy, slice-of-life, narrative game; about music, friendship, and maturing. Playing as Gordy, you’ll go to band practice, manage Gordy’s finances, her wellbeing, and try to find enough time and money to cover... well, everything.\\nGordy\'s life is a mess. Decide where Gordy’s priorities lie to shape the future of the band. With different endings, you\'ll have the chance to help Gordy grow in a ton of different ways.\\n\\n\\nLong-term friendships can be messy, especially when everyone grows up at their own pace. Can you stop a job, a relationship or a lifestyle from hurting the band?\\n\\nOn top of everything else, the band\'s first taste of success comes at the cost of Gordy’s mental health and physical wellbeing. Just how much is she willing to sacrifice for fame? Or for justice?\\n\\n\\nFrom the creators of Welcome to Elk, dive into the demon world of New Void City, and give your childhood dreams one last chance.\\nIt’s time to get loud, grow up, and rock out.\\n\",\"released\":\"2026-02-05\",\"background_image\":\"https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/375/375ccacac093b9fde0ad82ebb021b483.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"rating_top\":0,\"playtime\":0,\"esrb_rating\":\"Not Rated\",\"platforms\":[{\"platform\":{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"macOS\",\"slug\":\"macos\"}},{\"platform\":{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"PC\",\"slug\":\"pc\"}}],\"genres\":[],\"developers\":[{\"id\":102260,\"name\":\"Triple Topping\",\"slug\":\"triple-topping\"}],\"publishers\":[{\"id\":4650,\"name\":\"Akupara Games\",\"slug\":\"akupara-games\"}],\"tags\":[{\"id\":67,\"name\":\"Management\",\"slug\":\"management\"},{\"id\":136,\"name\":\"Music\",\"slug\":\"music\"},{\"id\":2030,\"name\":\"city\",\"slug\":\"city\"},{\"id\":295,\"name\":\"Soundtrack\",\"slug\":\"soundtrack\"},{\"id\":3068,\"name\":\"future\",\"slug\":\"future\"},{\"id\":782,\"name\":\"humor\",\"slug\":\"humor\"},{\"id\":688,\"name\":\"relationship\",\"slug\":\"relationship\"},{\"id\":2384,\"name\":\"rock\",\"slug\":\"rock\"},{\"id\":4934,\"name\":\"health\",\"slug\":\"health\"},{\"id\":653,\"name\":\"Dogs\",\"slug\":\"dogs\"},{\"id\":2201,\"name\":\"grow\",\"slug\":\"grow\"},{\"id\":641,\"name\":\"friendship\",\"slug\":\"friendship\"},{\"id\":3729,\"name\":\"choices\",\"slug\":\"choices\"},{\"id\":827,\"name\":\"choice\",\"slug\":\"choice\"},{\"id\":7258,\"name\":\"shape\",\"slug\":\"shape\"},{\"id\":1444,\"name\":\"punk\",\"slug\":\"punk\"},{\"id\":92376,\"name\":\"Aventure\",\"slug\":\"aventure\"},{\"id\":5523,\"name\":\"points\",\"slug\":\"points\"},{\"id\":2267,\"name\":\"pets\",\"slug\":\"pets\"},{\"id\":4835,\"name\":\"minigame\",\"slug\":\"minigame\"},{\"id\":8609,\"name\":\"practice\",\"slug\":\"practice\"}],\"screenshots\":[{\"id\":4297616,\"image\":\"https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/85f/85ff0a5831be99d9a